# Data caches — regenerated by loaders.py / loaders_lcb.py.
# /data/evidence/ is the exception: the published Stage-3 evidence package
# (see docs/correction_2026-07-12.md) is tracked — the correction's whole
# point is that the evidence ships with the claim. The nested data dirs
# (paper/data/, paper/figs/data/) stay ignored as before; force-added files
# in them remain tracked.
/data/*
!/data/evidence/
# /data/sft_scaling/ + its two source corpora are tracked for the same reason:
# the token-scaling prereg's matched-budget sets must ship with the claim.
!/data/sft_scaling/
# /data/propensity/ tracked: frozen item sets + rubrics + markers are the
# propensity-panel prereg's item-freeze addendum material (upstream/ is the
# pinned-commit raw copy; frozen/ is what the scorer consumes).
!/data/propensity/
!/data/sft_rationale_train.jsonl
!/data/sft_rationale_stripped_train.jsonl
!/data/sft_train.jsonl
!/data/problems_lcb_clean17.jsonl
!/data/problems_lcb_alwaysviolate5.jsonl
!/data/problems_humaneval100.jsonl
!/data/problems_mbpp30.jsonl
!/data/DECKS.md
paper/data/
paper/figs/data/

# Raw sweep outputs — large, regenerable, model-output dumps
results/raw/
results/logs/

# Curated examples are kept (results/examples/)

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Local config / credentials (never commit)
.vast_api_key
.fastai_key
.hf_token
*.env
*.local

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude Code session artifacts
.claude/
vast_logs/
vast_current.env

# LaTeX build artifacts
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.synctex.gz

# Editor backup files
*.bak
paper/data/cohort/problems_eval.jsonl
